  <wpt lat="48.682873" lon="-113.478144">
    <ele>1408.5</ele>
    <name>St Mary (access: CDT near St Mary Lake (Red Eagle))</name>
    <desc>mi 60.4 (SOBO mi 60.4) | off. mi 60.4 | MT | MT (not on an extracted map page) | Leave the CDT here for St Mary: 6 mi by hitching. St. Mary Supermarket is a genuine grocery, unusual for a Glacier gateway, alongside St. Mary Village&apos;s motels and restaurants. Around 7% of 2026 hikers resupplied here; most carry through to East Glacier. Seasonal.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="48.742223" lon="-113.429731">
    <ele>1371.6</ele>
    <name>St Mary</name>
    <desc>mi 60.4 (SOBO mi 60.4) | off. mi 60.4 | MT | MT (not on an extracted map page) | St. Mary Supermarket is a genuine grocery, unusual for a Glacier gateway, alongside St. Mary Village&apos;s motels and restaurants. Around 7% of 2026 hikers resupplied here; most carry through to East Glacier. Seasonal. The trail&apos;s nearest approach is on the Red Eagle side of St Mary Lake; the practical exit is the Going-to-the-Sun Road. 6 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
