  <wpt lat="47.49516" lon="-112.90054">
    <ele>1624.6</ele>
    <name>Benchmark Wilderness Ranch (access: CDT at Benchmark trailhead (South Fork Sun River))</name>
    <desc>mi 234.5 (SOBO mi 234.5) | off. mi 234.5 | MT | MT (not on an extracted map page) | Leave the CDT here for Benchmark Wilderness Ranch: 2.5 mi on foot. Box drop only - there is no shop. The ranch holds hiker packages for a fee and it is the standard way to break the long Lincoln-to-East Glacier carry through the Bob Marshall.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.479" lon="-112.876">
    <ele>1615.4</ele>
    <name>Benchmark Wilderness Ranch</name>
    <desc>mi 234.5 (SOBO mi 234.5) | off. mi 234.5 | MT | MT (not on an extracted map page) | Box drop only - there is no shop. The ranch holds hiker packages for a fee and it is the standard way to break the long Lincoln-to-East Glacier carry through the Bob Marshall. Current guidance: maximum 12 x 12 x 12 inches, $30 by cash or cheque in a separate envelope, sent two to three weeks ahead, addressed care of the ranch at 422 County Line Road, Fairfield, MT 59436. TrailQuest still lists the fee as $25, so confirm before sending. Coordinates are the Benchmark road-end area and are approximate: the ranch has no OpenStreetMap entry. Accepts resupply boxes. 2.5 mi off trail on foot. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <link href="https://benchmarkwildernessranch.com/" />
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.49516" lon="-112.90054">
    <ele>1624.6</ele>
    <name>Augusta (access: CDT at Benchmark trailhead (South Fork Sun River))</name>
    <desc>mi 234.5 (SOBO mi 234.5) | off. mi 234.5 | MT | MT (not on an extracted map page) | Leave the CDT here for Augusta: 30 mi by hitching. Allen&apos;s Manix Store is a general store - enough for a few days, not a supermarket. Motel, bar and cafe. Thirty miles of gravel out from the Benchmark trailhead with very little traffic, so the hitch is the hard part;…</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.493242" lon="-112.39106">
    <ele>1240.5</ele>
    <name>Augusta</name>
    <desc>mi 234.5 (SOBO mi 234.5) | off. mi 234.5 | MT | MT (not on an extracted map page) | Allen&apos;s Manix Store is a general store - enough for a few days, not a supermarket. Motel, bar and cafe. Thirty miles of gravel out from the Benchmark trailhead with very little traffic, so the hitch is the hard part; hikers who cannot get a ride use the Benchmark box drop instead. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 102 Walrath Street, Augusta, MT 59410 (general delivery). 30 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
