  <wpt lat="46.561487" lon="-112.308748">
    <ele>1927.3</ele>
    <name>Helena (access: MacDonald Pass (US 12))</name>
    <desc>mi 360.1 (SOBO mi 360.1) | off. mi 360.2 | MT | MT map 368 | Leave the CDT here for Helena: 15 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community and the largest town on the Montana section: Safeway, Albertsons, Walmart, Super 1, outdoor shops, an airport and buses. Fifteen miles east of MacDonald Pass on US 12.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="46.590592" lon="-112.017254">
    <ele>1181.1</ele>
    <name>Helena</name>
    <desc>mi 360.1 (SOBO mi 360.1) | off. mi 360.2 | MT | MT map 368 | CDTC Gateway Community and the largest town on the Montana section: Safeway, Albertsons, Walmart, Super 1, outdoor shops, an airport and buses. Fifteen miles east of MacDonald Pass on US 12. The Last Chance station at 500 North Last Chance Gulch is the downtown post office and closer to the hostels than the main office on North Harris. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 2300 North Harris Street, Helena, MT 59601 (general delivery). 15 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="46.561487" lon="-112.308748">
    <ele>1927.3</ele>
    <name>Elliston (access: MacDonald Pass (US 12))</name>
    <desc>mi 360.1 (SOBO mi 360.1) | off. mi 360.2 | MT | MT map 368 | Leave the CDT here for Elliston: 6 mi by hitching. Six miles west of MacDonald Pass on US 12: the Elliston Country Store, a bar and the post office, and that is close to all of it.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="46.560708" lon="-112.430297">
    <ele>1554.5</ele>
    <name>Elliston</name>
    <desc>mi 360.1 (SOBO mi 360.1) | off. mi 360.2 | MT | MT map 368 | Six miles west of MacDonald Pass on US 12: the Elliston Country Store, a bar and the post office, and that is close to all of it. Listed in the older TrailQuest address list as a box drop and still used by hikers who do not want the Helena detour. Coordinate is the country store; the post office is next door. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 101 West Front Street, Elliston, MT 59728 (general delivery). 6 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
