    <name>Butte (access: I-15 at Elk Park Pass)</name>
    <desc>mi 448.4 (SOBO mi 448.4) | off. mi 448.8 | MT | MT map 359 | Leave the CDT here for Butte: 6 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community. Two Safeways, Walmart, a natural grocery uptown, gear shops and buses. The trail crosses I-15 at Elk Park Pass north of town and I-90 at Homestake Pass east of it, so there are two easy ways in;…</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.997712" lon="-112.537256">
    <ele>1688.6</ele>
    <name>Butte</name>
    <desc>mi 448.4 (SOBO mi 448.4) | off. mi 448.8 | MT | MT map 359 | CDTC Gateway Community. Two Safeways, Walmart, a natural grocery uptown, gear shops and buses. The trail crosses I-15 at Elk Park Pass north of town and I-90 at Homestake Pass east of it, so there are two easy ways in; the Elk Park crossing is about 6 miles out. Hikers who take the Anaconda Cut-off skip Butte entirely - the two are alternatives, not both. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 60 West Galena Street, Butte, MT 59701 (general delivery). 6 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
