  <wpt lat="45.695156" lon="-113.935349">
    <ele>2233.7</ele>
    <name>Sula (access: Lost Trail Pass (US 93 / MT 43))</name>
    <desc>mi 630.2 (SOBO mi 630.2) | off. mi 631.4 | MT | MT map 338 | Leave the CDT here for Sula: 8 mi by hitching. Sula Country Store and Resort on US 93, 8 miles north of Lost Trail Pass. Small store, cabins, fuel. Fewer options than Salmon or Darby but far the easiest hitch of the three.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.836306" lon="-113.982525">
    <ele>1341.1</ele>
    <name>Sula</name>
    <desc>mi 630.2 (SOBO mi 630.2) | off. mi 631.4 | MT | MT map 338 | Sula Country Store and Resort on US 93, 8 miles north of Lost Trail Pass. Small store, cabins, fuel. Fewer options than Salmon or Darby but far the easiest hitch of the three. Post office is a couple of miles further up the East Fork road, not at the store. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 502 East Fork Road, Sula, MT 59871 (general delivery). 8 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.685884" lon="-113.933344">
    <ele>2219.9</ele>
    <name>Wisdom (access: Chief Joseph Pass (MT 43))</name>
    <desc>mi 631.0 (SOBO mi 631.0) | off. mi 632.1 | MT | MT map 338 | Leave the CDT here for Wisdom: 22 mi by hitching. Wisdom Market in the Big Hole valley, 22 miles east of Chief Joseph Pass on MT 43. Small - tagged as a supermarket in OpenStreetMap but it is a village store. Post office is next door.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.61745" lon="-113.450474">
    <ele>1847.1</ele>
    <name>Wisdom</name>
    <desc>mi 631.0 (SOBO mi 631.0) | off. mi 632.1 | MT | MT map 338 | Wisdom Market in the Big Hole valley, 22 miles east of Chief Joseph Pass on MT 43. Small - tagged as a supermarket in OpenStreetMap but it is a village store. Post office is next door. A quiet road with light traffic; the hitch can take a while. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 200 Main Street, Wisdom, MT 59761 (general delivery). 22 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
