    <desc>mi 631.0 (SOBO mi 631.0) | off. mi 632.1 | MT | MT map 338 | Leave the CDT here for Darby: 30 mi by hitching. Peoples Market plus two mercantiles and a Family Dollar, in the Bitterroot valley about 30 miles north-west of Chief Joseph Pass on US 93.</desc>
