  <wpt lat="46.028494" lon="-114.178733">
    <ele>1185.1</ele>
    <name>Darby</name>
    <desc>mi 631.0 (SOBO mi 631.0) | off. mi 632.1 | MT | MT map 338 | Peoples Market plus two mercantiles and a Family Dollar, in the Bitterroot valley about 30 miles north-west of Chief Joseph Pass on US 93. A real grocery, and the standard stop for hikers who do not want to rely on Leadore or Lima. Some 2026 hikers argue for carrying on to Hamilton, 20 miles further north, for cheaper prices and more choice. Accepts resupply boxes. 30 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
