  <wpt lat="45.237288" lon="-113.516446">
    <ele>2244.4</ele>
    <name>Jackson (access: CDT primary route nearest Jackson (Big Hole divide))</name>
    <desc>mi 692.5 (SOBO mi 692.5) | off. mi 694.0 | MT | MT map 331 | Leave the CDT here for Jackson: 20 mi by hitching. Jackson Mercantile and the Jackson Hot Springs Lodge, a very small Big Hole settlement. A minor stop, used mostly by hikers coming off the trail west of town rather than continuing to Wisdom.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.368076" lon="-113.409625">
    <ele>1975.1</ele>
    <name>Jackson</name>
    <desc>mi 692.5 (SOBO mi 692.5) | off. mi 694.0 | MT | MT map 331 | Jackson Mercantile and the Jackson Hot Springs Lodge, a very small Big Hole settlement. A minor stop, used mostly by hikers coming off the trail west of town rather than continuing to Wisdom. The road distance here is uncertain: the CDTC primary line does not cross Big Hole Pass, and its nearest approach is a rough forest road, so treat accessRoadMiles as an estimate. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 1 Jardine Street, Jackson, MT 59736 (general delivery). 20 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
