    <name>Leadore (access: Bannock Pass (ID 29 / MT 324))</name>
    <desc>mi 753.1 (SOBO mi 753.1) | off. mi 754.8 | MT | MT map 322 | Leave the CDT here for Leadore: 13 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community (as Lemhi County). Effectively a mail drop: a gas station, two restaurants that are often shut, and the post office.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="44.680339" lon="-113.357966">
    <ele>1834.9</ele>
    <name>Leadore</name>
    <desc>mi 753.1 (SOBO mi 753.1) | off. mi 754.8 | MT | MT map 322 | CDTC Gateway Community (as Lemhi County). Effectively a mail drop: a gas station, two restaurants that are often shut, and the post office. Hikers consistently report basic-to-nothing on the shelves and recommend sending a box. Thirteen miles west of Bannock Pass on ID 29, and the hitch is notoriously slow - the road carries almost no traffic. Coordinate is the post office; there is no grocery in OpenStreetMap here. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 115 South Railroad Street, Leadore, ID 83464 (general delivery). 13 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="44.814332" lon="-113.27255">
    <ele>2339.7</ele>
    <name>Salmon (access: Bannock Pass (ID 29 / MT 324))</name>
    <desc>mi 753.1 (SOBO mi 753.1) | off. mi 754.8 | MT | MT map 322 | Leave the CDT here for Salmon: 45 mi by hitching. The full-supermarket alternative to Leadore: Saveway Market, a health-food shop, a discount store, motels. About 45 miles from Bannock Pass and a long hitch, but several 2026 hikers recommend it over Leadore for price…</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.174867" lon="-113.88604">
    <ele>1202.1</ele>
    <name>Salmon</name>
    <desc>mi 753.1 (SOBO mi 753.1) | off. mi 754.8 | MT | MT map 322 | The full-supermarket alternative to Leadore: Saveway Market, a health-food shop, a discount store, motels. About 45 miles from Bannock Pass and a long hitch, but several 2026 hikers recommend it over Leadore for price and choice. Also reachable from Lemhi Pass down the Agency Creek road. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 600 Shoup Street, Salmon, ID 83467 (general delivery). 45 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
