  <wpt lat="44.599249" lon="-111.522403">
    <ele>2181.4</ele>
    <name>Mack&apos;s Inn (Island Park) (access: Red Rock Pass)</name>
    <desc>mi 918.8 (SOBO mi 918.8) | off. mi 921.1 | MT | MT map 300 | Leave the CDT here for Mack&apos;s Inn (Island Park): 15 mi by hitching. The Stage Stop convenience store and the Macks Inn post office, on US 20 in Island Park. Very basic; the nearest thing to a supermarket is Sam Patch Co / Robins Roost about 2 miles north.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="44.499584" lon="-111.336878">
    <ele>1935.5</ele>
    <name>Mack&apos;s Inn (Island Park)</name>
    <desc>mi 918.8 (SOBO mi 918.8) | off. mi 921.1 | MT | MT map 300 | The Stage Stop convenience store and the Macks Inn post office, on US 20 in Island Park. Very basic; the nearest thing to a supermarket is Sam Patch Co / Robins Roost about 2 miles north. On-trail if you take the Mack&apos;s Inn alternate out of Yellowstone, otherwise a 15-mile hitch from Red Rock Pass. The USGS dataset has two post offices in Island Park - Macks Inn at 4110 South Big Springs Loop Road is the one hikers use. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 4110 South Big Springs Loop Road, Island Park, ID 83433 (general delivery). 15 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
