  <wpt lat="44.653219" lon="-111.24811">
    <ele>2354.8</ele>
    <name>West Yellowstone (access: Targhee Pass (US 20))</name>
    <desc>mi 956.3 (SOBO mi 956.3) | off. mi 958.7 | MT | MT map 296 | Leave the CDT here for West Yellowstone: 9 mi by hitching. Two supermarkets - Food Roundup and Market Place - plus every kind of tourist service, 9 miles east of Targhee Pass on US 20. The main full resupply between Old Faithful and Lima, and much better stocked than either.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="44.660851" lon="-111.101514">
    <ele>2032.1</ele>
    <name>West Yellowstone</name>
    <desc>mi 956.3 (SOBO mi 956.3) | off. mi 958.7 | MT | MT map 296 | Two supermarkets - Food Roundup and Market Place - plus every kind of tourist service, 9 miles east of Targhee Pass on US 20. The main full resupply between Old Faithful and Lima, and much better stocked than either. Expensive in season. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 209 Grizzly Avenue, West Yellowstone, MT 59758 (general delivery). 9 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
