    <desc>mi 985.5 (SOBO mi 985.5) | off. mi 987.9 | MT | WY map 292 | CDTC official mile 2050, counted northbound from Crazy Cook. Official SOBO mile 987.9; geometric SOBO mile 985.5.</desc>
