  <wpt lat="44.456794" lon="-110.827906">
    <ele>2240.3</ele>
    <name>Old Faithful Village</name>
    <desc>mi 1004.6 (SOBO mi 1004.6) | off. mi 1007.0 | WY | WY map 289 | Two Yellowstone general stores and a post office, right on the trail. Resupply is basic and expensive - snack food and camp meals rather than groceries - so most hikers send a box. Mark the package clearly CDT HIKER or it can end up at Mammoth. Backcountry permits for the Yellowstone crossing are a separate problem and need arranging well ahead. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: General Delivery, Old Faithful Village, WY 82190 (general delivery). 0.3 mi off trail along the trail. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.yellowstonevacations.com/yellowstone-general-stores/" />
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="44.457161" lon="-110.828487">
