    <desc>mi 1032.4 (SOBO mi 1032.4) | off. mi 1035.0 | WY | WY map 285 | General store, campground and post office on the West Thumb of Yellowstone Lake. Limited and expensive; most hikers skip it and use Old Faithful, though it is the natural place to collect a backcountry permit for the southern half of the park. Roughly 5 miles from the trail&apos;s nearest approach along the Shoshone Lake side. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: General Delivery, Grant Village, Yellowstone National Park, WY 82190 (general delivery). 5 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
