    <desc>mi 1099.0 (SOBO mi 1099.0) | off. mi 1101.9 | WY | WY map 275 | Sublette / Two Ocean / Sheridan: 32.6 mi against 28.4 mi on the CDT, +4,711 ft. OSM relation 8013187 (ref:cdtc &apos;WY bcs 16W&apos;), 31.6 mi, made of the Sublette Mountain alternate (r1330433) and the Sheridan - Two Ocean - Togwotee alternate (r1330432). The classic way through the Teton Wilderness between Two Ocean Pass and Togwotee Pass. OSM relation extract repaired: the relation is missing the ways that carry the route across a 1.3 km hole at 43.7610, -110.0179, so that stretch was routed over OSM highway ways 90486622, 897739685, 1133760925, 1133760929, 1133760930 (1.4 km) fetched separately from Overpass. The joined line is 32.9 mi and attaches 10 m / 89 m from the primary line; `data/external/osm-joined/sublette-two-ocean-sheridan.geojson` is the file the build reads, and `data/external/osm/` still holds the untouched relation extract.</desc>
    <type>junction</type>
