    <desc>mi 1106.1 (SOBO mi 1106.1) | off. mi 1109.0 | WY | WY map 275 | Leave the CDT here for Dubois: 30 mi by hitching. Lynn&apos;s Superfoods is a proper supermarket, plus Welty&apos;s General Store, a Family Dollar, motels and restaurants - hikers describe it as having everything.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.536327" lon="-109.640539">
    <ele>2108.3</ele>
    <name>Dubois</name>
    <desc>mi 1106.1 (SOBO mi 1106.1) | off. mi 1109.0 | WY | WY map 275 | Lynn&apos;s Superfoods is a proper supermarket, plus Welty&apos;s General Store, a Family Dollar, motels and restaurants - hikers describe it as having everything. Reached from Togwotee Pass on US 26/287, about 30 miles east, or from Union Pass on the older CDT line to the south. Which of those you use depends on which route you take through the Wind Rivers, and the two are a long way apart. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 804 Ramshorn Street, Dubois, WY 82513 (general delivery). 30 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
