  <wpt lat="43.046061" lon="-109.62702">
    <ele>3274.9</ele>
    <name>Pinedale (access: CDT at Pole Creek / Elkhart Park trailhead)</name>
    <desc>mi 1195.5 (SOBO mi 1195.5) | off. mi 1198.7 | WY | WY map 262 | Leave the CDT here for Pinedale: 15 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community and the Wind River resupply. Ridley&apos;s Family Market is a full supermarket; there is also a health-food shop, a produce shop, an outdoor store, a Dollar General, motels and a laundromat.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.867263" lon="-109.856279">
    <ele>2186.9</ele>
    <name>Pinedale</name>
    <desc>mi 1195.5 (SOBO mi 1195.5) | off. mi 1198.7 | WY | WY map 262 | CDTC Gateway Community and the Wind River resupply. Ridley&apos;s Family Market is a full supermarket; there is also a health-food shop, a produce shop, an outdoor store, a Dollar General, motels and a laundromat. Reached by hitching down the Elkhart Park or Pole Creek trailhead road, roughly 15 miles; hikers coming out at Green River Lakes have a longer road walk. Guides put Pinedale anywhere between mile 1798 and 1833 NOBO depending on which Wind River route you take. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 413 Pine Street, Pinedale, WY 82941 (general delivery). 15 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
