    <desc>mi 1252.8 (SOBO mi 1252.8) | off. mi 1256.4 | WY | WY map 254 | Wyoming old route 1: 18.6 mi against 21.2 mi on the CDT, +1,469 ft. OSM relation 8145969 &apos;CDT -a-XX Continental Divide Trail Misc Alernate Old Routes&apos;. The relation is a bag of disconnected old-route fragments spread across the Great Divide Basin, the Sierra Madre and the Wyoming/Colorado border, not one alternate, so each of its 11 chains is registered separately. Chain 1 of 11, 18.6 mi, centred on 42.5082, -109.0111; its ends sit 7 m and 2 m from the CDTC primary line.</desc>
