  <wpt lat="42.485601" lon="-108.729092">
    <ele>2428.1</ele>
    <name>Atlantic City (access: CDT at Atlantic City)</name>
    <desc>mi 1283.4 (SOBO mi 1283.4) | off. mi 1287.1 | WY | WY map 249 | Leave the CDT here for Atlantic City: 0.8 mi on foot. The Atlantic City Mercantile - a bar and general store in a gold-rush building - and Wild Bill&apos;s Hikers &amp; Bikers B&amp;B, which caters specifically to CDT and Great Divide Route travellers.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.496536" lon="-108.730333">
    <ele>2340.9</ele>
    <name>Atlantic City</name>
    <desc>mi 1283.4 (SOBO mi 1283.4) | off. mi 1287.1 | WY | WY map 249 | The Atlantic City Mercantile - a bar and general store in a gold-rush building - and Wild Bill&apos;s Hikers &amp; Bikers B&amp;B, which caters specifically to CDT and Great Divide Route travellers. The trail passes within half a mile. Resupply is thin; hikers who need real groceries carry on to Lander. Guides put it at roughly mile 1714-1724 NOBO. Bear spray is recommended from here north. Accepts resupply boxes. 0.8 mi off trail on foot. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
