  <wpt lat="41.794595" lon="-107.217303">
    <ele>2083.3</ele>
    <name>Rawlins</name>
    <desc>mi 1396.7 (SOBO mi 1396.7) | off. mi 1400.6 | WY | WY map 230 | CDTC Gateway Community, and the trail walks through it. City Market and Walmart, plus motels and an Amtrak stop. The full resupply either side of the Great Divide Basin, and the last real town before the Colorado line for southbounders. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 106 5th Street, Rawlins, WY 82301 (general delivery). 1.5 mi off trail along the trail. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
