    <desc>mi 1478.1 (SOBO mi 1478.1) | off. mi 1482.2 | WY | WY map 217 | Leave the CDT here for Encampment: 18 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community (with Riverside), 18 miles east of Battle Pass on WY 70. Limited grocery - CDTC and Halfway Anywhere both flag it as a town where hikers should send a box - plus a liquor store, a lodge and a…</desc>
