  <wpt lat="41.207011" lon="-106.79175">
    <ele>2232.1</ele>
    <name>Encampment</name>
    <desc>mi 1478.1 (SOBO mi 1478.1) | off. mi 1482.2 | WY | WY map 217 | CDTC Gateway Community (with Riverside), 18 miles east of Battle Pass on WY 70. Limited grocery - CDTC and Halfway Anywhere both flag it as a town where hikers should send a box - plus a liquor store, a lodge and a museum. OpenStreetMap has no grocery tagged in Encampment at all, so the coordinate here is the post office. Riverside, two miles east, has the Trading Post convenience store. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 622 McCaffrey Avenue, Encampment, WY 82325 (general delivery). 18 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.153749" lon="-106.981306">
    <ele>3033</ele>
    <name>Riverside (access: Battle Pass (WY 70))</name>
    <desc>mi 1478.1 (SOBO mi 1478.1) | off. mi 1482.2 | WY | WY map 217 | Leave the CDT here for Riverside: 20 mi by hitching. Two miles north-east of Encampment on WY 230: the Trading Post convenience store, the Mangy Moose bar, a garage with cabins, and an RV park that takes tenting hikers.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.216546" lon="-106.782632">
    <ele>2179.3</ele>
    <name>Riverside</name>
    <desc>mi 1478.1 (SOBO mi 1478.1) | off. mi 1482.2 | WY | WY map 217 | Two miles north-east of Encampment on WY 230: the Trading Post convenience store, the Mangy Moose bar, a garage with cabins, and an RV park that takes tenting hikers. Between them Encampment and Riverside make one adequate stop; neither is one on its own. Named with Encampment as a CDTC Gateway Community. 20 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
