    <name>Steamboat Springs (access: Buffalo Pass)</name>
    <desc>mi 1544.7 (SOBO mi 1544.7) | off. mi 1549.1 | CO | CO map 206 | Leave the CDT here for Steamboat Springs: 15 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community and one of the most-used stops on the trail. City Market, Safeway, Natural Grocers, Walmart, gear shops, buses, hot springs.</desc>
