  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="40.463066" lon="-106.821603">
    <ele>2051.9</ele>
    <name>Steamboat Springs</name>
    <desc>mi 1544.7 (SOBO mi 1544.7) | off. mi 1549.1 | CO | CO map 206 | CDTC Gateway Community and one of the most-used stops on the trail. City Market, Safeway, Natural Grocers, Walmart, gear shops, buses, hot springs. Fifteen miles west of Buffalo Pass on a rough forest road that plenty of hikers walk rather than wait on; the paved US 40 crossing at Rabbit Ears Pass, further south, is the easier hitch and about the same distance. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 200 Lincoln Avenue, Steamboat Springs, CO 80487 (general delivery). 15 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
