    <desc>mi 1865.3 (SOBO mi 1865.3) | off. mi 1871.4 | CO | CO map 166 | Leave the CDT here for Twin Lakes: 1.5 mi on foot. CDTC Gateway Community (with Leadville). The Twin Lakes General Store stocks deliberately hiker-oriented food and holds CDT and Colorado Trail packages - address them care of the store at 6451 East State Highway 82,…</desc>
