  <wpt lat="39.082021" lon="-106.382264">
    <ele>2804.2</ele>
    <name>Twin Lakes</name>
    <desc>mi 1865.3 (SOBO mi 1865.3) | off. mi 1871.4 | CO | CO map 166 | CDTC Gateway Community (with Leadville). The Twin Lakes General Store stocks deliberately hiker-oriented food and holds CDT and Colorado Trail packages - address them care of the store at 6451 East State Highway 82, Twin Lakes, CO 81251. Limited beyond that: a couple of lodges and a cafe. About a mile off the trail where it crosses CO 82. Where the Collegiate East and West routes divide. Accepts resupply boxes. 1.5 mi off trail on foot. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.twinlakesgs.com/" />
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
