    <desc>mi 1903.8 (SOBO mi 1903.8) | off. mi 1910.1 | CO | CO map 161 | Leave the CDT here for Buena Vista: 20 mi by hitching. City Market on US 24 plus a health-food shop and a second supermarket at the north end, hostels and a brewery. Reached from the Collegiate West route down the Cottonwood Pass road, about 20 miles, or from the Collegiate…</desc>
