  <wpt lat="38.836884" lon="-106.131169">
    <ele>2427.7</ele>
    <name>Buena Vista</name>
    <desc>mi 1903.8 (SOBO mi 1903.8) | off. mi 1910.1 | CO | CO map 161 | City Market on US 24 plus a health-food shop and a second supermarket at the north end, hostels and a brewery. Reached from the Collegiate West route down the Cottonwood Pass road, about 20 miles, or from the Collegiate East route much more directly. Only on the Collegiate East line is it a short hop; from the CDTC primary over Cottonwood Pass it is a long descent. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 110 Brookdale Avenue, Buena Vista, CO 81211 (general delivery). 20 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
