    <desc>mi 1947.0 (SOBO mi 1947.0) | off. mi 1953.5 | CO | CO map 156 | Colorado old route 4: 1.1 mi against 1.5 mi on the CDT, +92 ft. OSM relation 2522292 &apos;CDT in-xx Misc Old Route Alternates&apos;, noted &apos;Currently only including segments betweens Sections 9-16 of the Colorado Trail&apos;. The relation is a bag of disconnected old-route fragments, not one alternate, so each of its 7 chains is registered separately. Chain 4 of 7, 1.1 mi, centred on 38.4957, -106.3317; its ends sit 6 m and 0 m from the CDTC primary line.</desc>
    <type>junction</type>
  </wpt>
