    <desc>mi 1947.3 (SOBO mi 1947.3) | off. mi 1953.7 | CO | CO map 156 | Leave the CDT here for Salida: 22 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community and the best rest day in southern Colorado: Safeway, Walmart, Natural Grocers, a hiker-friendly downtown, hot springs, hostels.</desc>
