  <wpt lat="38.536143" lon="-105.994385">
    <ele>2158.9</ele>
    <name>Salida</name>
    <desc>mi 1947.3 (SOBO mi 1947.3) | off. mi 1953.7 | CO | CO map 156 | CDTC Gateway Community and the best rest day in southern Colorado: Safeway, Walmart, Natural Grocers, a hiker-friendly downtown, hot springs, hostels. Twenty-two miles east of Monarch Pass on US 50, a busy highway and a reliable hitch. Poncha Springs, on the way in, has a small grocery of its own if you do not want the full run. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 310 D Street, Salida, CO 81201 (general delivery). 22 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="38.496295" lon="-106.325116">
    <ele>3449.2</ele>
