    <desc>mi 1947.3 (SOBO mi 1947.3) | off. mi 1953.7 | CO | CO map 156 | Leave the CDT here for Poncha Springs: 17 mi by hitching. LaGree&apos;s Food Store and Poncha Market at the US 50 / US 285 junction, five miles short of Salida on the way in from Monarch Pass.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="38.515897" lon="-106.075857">
    <ele>2276.6</ele>
    <name>Poncha Springs</name>
    <desc>mi 1947.3 (SOBO mi 1947.3) | off. mi 1953.7 | CO | CO map 156 | LaGree&apos;s Food Store and Poncha Market at the US 50 / US 285 junction, five miles short of Salida on the way in from Monarch Pass. Enough for a few days if the hitch stalls here, which it often does; otherwise carry on to Salida. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 6500 US Highway 285, Poncha Springs, CO 81242 (general delivery). 17 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="38.496705" lon="-106.325417">
    <ele>3447.9</ele>
    <name>Monarch Pass (Monarch Crest Store)</name>
    <desc>mi 1947.3 (SOBO mi 1947.3) | off. mi 1953.7 | CO | CO map 156 | Monarch Crest Food &amp; Gifts, at the top of the pass where the trail crosses US 50 - a gift shop and cafe with some groceries and a restaurant. Enough to top up a couple of days, and the obvious place to start hitching to Salida. Seasonal hours; it is not open all year. 0.1 mi off trail along the trail. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
