    <desc>mi 2047.6 (SOBO mi 2047.6) | off. mi 2054.2 | CO | CO map 141 | Leave the CDT here for Lake City: 17 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community and the standard San Juan resupply, preferred by most hikers over the harder Silverton detour.</desc>
