    <ele>2642.9</ele>
    <name>Lake City</name>
    <desc>mi 2047.6 (SOBO mi 2047.6) | off. mi 2054.2 | CO | CO map 141 | CDTC Gateway Community and the standard San Juan resupply, preferred by most hikers over the harder Silverton detour. Get Some Groceries and the Country Store Grocery are small but adequate; there is a hostel, motels and a hiker-friendly reputation. Seventeen miles north of Spring Creek Pass on CO 149, a quiet road where the hitch can be slow. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 803 Gunnison Avenue, Lake City, CO 81235 (general delivery). 17 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="37.940151" lon="-107.15883">
