    <desc>mi 2047.6 (SOBO mi 2047.6) | off. mi 2054.2 | CO | CO map 141 | Leave the CDT here for Creede: 22 mi by hitching. Kentucky Belle Market on Main Street - the OSM name is spelled Kentucky Bell - with winter and summer hours, plus motels and a hostel.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="37.851763" lon="-106.927229">
    <ele>2698.1</ele>
    <name>Creede</name>
    <desc>mi 2047.6 (SOBO mi 2047.6) | off. mi 2054.2 | CO | CO map 141 | Kentucky Belle Market on Main Street - the OSM name is spelled Kentucky Bell - with winter and summer hours, plus motels and a hostel. Reached either by hitching about 22 miles south from Spring Creek Pass on CO 149, or directly if you take the Creede Cutoff, a lower and less snowbound alternate that some hikers use instead of the high San Juan line. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 10 South Main Street, Creede, CO 81130 (general delivery). 22 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
