    <desc>mi 2164.0 (SOBO mi 2164.0) | off. mi 2171.2 | CO | CO map 126 | Leave the CDT here for Pagosa Springs: 23 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community. Walmart, Natural Grocers, City Market, hot springs, breweries - the best of the two towns either side of Wolf Creek Pass, and the one most hikers choose.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="37.259596" lon="-107.063284">
    <ele>2172</ele>
    <name>Pagosa Springs</name>
    <desc>mi 2164.0 (SOBO mi 2164.0) | off. mi 2171.2 | CO | CO map 126 | CDTC Gateway Community. Walmart, Natural Grocers, City Market, hot springs, breweries - the best of the two towns either side of Wolf Creek Pass, and the one most hikers choose. Twenty-three miles west of the pass on US 160; South Fork is 18 miles east and smaller. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 250 Hot Springs Boulevard, Pagosa Springs, CO 81147 (general delivery). 23 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="37.483373" lon="-106.800875">
    <ele>3320.1</ele>
    <name>South Fork (access: Wolf Creek Pass (US 160))</name>
    <desc>mi 2164.0 (SOBO mi 2164.0) | off. mi 2171.2 | CO | CO map 126 | Leave the CDT here for South Fork: 18 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community. Rainbow Grocery is a small full-service supermarket, with a Dollar General and motels alongside.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="37.670016" lon="-106.638633">
    <ele>2502.1</ele>
    <name>South Fork</name>
    <desc>mi 2164.0 (SOBO mi 2164.0) | off. mi 2171.2 | CO | CO map 126 | CDTC Gateway Community. Rainbow Grocery is a small full-service supermarket, with a Dollar General and motels alongside. Eighteen miles east of Wolf Creek Pass on US 160 - closer than Pagosa Springs and a shorter hitch, but a much smaller town. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 130 West Frontage Road, South Fork, CO 81154 (general delivery). 18 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
