    <ele>3320.1</ele>
    <name>Del Norte (access: Wolf Creek Pass (US 160))</name>
    <desc>mi 2164.0 (SOBO mi 2164.0) | off. mi 2171.2 | CO | CO map 126 | Leave the CDT here for Del Norte: 32 mi by hitching. Lowe&apos;s Market on Grand Avenue, in the San Luis Valley 32 miles east of Wolf Creek Pass. Not a standard CDT stop - South Fork and Pagosa Springs are both closer - but it has a proper grocery and it is the town hikers use…</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="37.677776" lon="-106.34507">
    <ele>2403</ele>
    <name>Del Norte</name>
    <desc>mi 2164.0 (SOBO mi 2164.0) | off. mi 2171.2 | CO | CO map 126 | Lowe&apos;s Market on Grand Avenue, in the San Luis Valley 32 miles east of Wolf Creek Pass. Not a standard CDT stop - South Fork and Pagosa Springs are both closer - but it has a proper grocery and it is the town hikers use if they are heading to or from the valley for any other reason. Accepts resupply boxes. 32 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
