    <desc>mi 2232.7 (SOBO mi 2232.7) | off. mi 2240.3 | CO | CO map 118 | Leave the CDT here for Chama: 12 mi by hitching. CDTC Gateway Community and the first or last New Mexico town. Lowe&apos;s Market at the south end of the village is a full grocery; there is also a Family Dollar, motels and restaurants, and the Cumbres &amp; Toltec railway.</desc>
