    <name>Ghost Ranch branches</name>
    <desc>mi 2319.3 (SOBO mi 2319.3) | off. mi 2327.1 | NM | NM map 107 | Ghost Ranch: 15.2 mi against 12.8 mi on the CDT, +2,200 ft. OSM relation 7920292, 22.9 mi, both ends within 90 m of the primary line. The official route now heads down Martinez Canyon; Ley&apos;s NM 6 note 1: &apos;It&apos;s a good route, but bypasses Ghost Ranch, and the badlands just north of it - real highlights of this area.&apos; Ghost Ranch itself has showers, laundry, cafeteria, store, campground and bunks. Made up in OSM of sub-relations 7900951 (jefGH), 7900943 (jejGH), 7900942 (jemGH).</desc>
