  <wpt lat="36.386622" lon="-106.445709">
    <ele>2231.3</ele>
    <name>Ghost Ranch (access: CDT primary route nearest Ghost Ranch (Chama River rim))</name>
    <desc>mi 2322.4 (SOBO mi 2322.4) | off. mi 2330.2 | NM | NM map 106 | Leave the CDT here for Ghost Ranch: 6 mi on foot. A Presbyterian conference and retreat centre in the Chama River badlands, on the Ghost Ranch alternate rather than the CDTC primary line.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="36.335257" lon="-106.469609">
    <ele>1981.2</ele>
    <name>Ghost Ranch</name>
    <desc>mi 2322.4 (SOBO mi 2322.4) | off. mi 2330.2 | NM | NM map 106 | A Presbyterian conference and retreat centre in the Chama River badlands, on the Ghost Ranch alternate rather than the CDTC primary line. Box drop plus meals in the dining hall, camping, cabins, showers and laundry - and no shop at all, so if you come here you must have sent a package. Address it to 280 Private Drive 1708, Abiquiu, NM 87510, marked Hold for CDT hiker with your ETA. Around half of surveyed hikers use it. The accessFrom point is the primary route&apos;s nearest approach; on the alternate the ranch is on your line. Accepts resupply boxes. 6 mi off trail on foot. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="36.386622" lon="-106.445709">
    <ele>2231.3</ele>
    <name>Abiquiu (access: CDT primary route nearest Ghost Ranch (Chama River rim))</name>
    <desc>mi 2322.4 (SOBO mi 2322.4) | off. mi 2330.2 | NM | NM map 106 | Leave the CDT here for Abiquiu: 20 mi by hitching. Bode&apos;s, a well-stocked general store, cafe and fuel stop on US 84 fourteen miles south of Ghost Ranch. Not a standard CDT stop, but it is the nearest place to Ghost Ranch where you can actually buy food rather than…</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="36.209748" lon="-106.320183">
    <ele>1847.1</ele>
    <name>Abiquiu</name>
    <desc>mi 2322.4 (SOBO mi 2322.4) | off. mi 2330.2 | NM | NM map 106 | Bode&apos;s, a well-stocked general store, cafe and fuel stop on US 84 fourteen miles south of Ghost Ranch. Not a standard CDT stop, but it is the nearest place to Ghost Ranch where you can actually buy food rather than collect it, and hikers whose box has gone astray end up here. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 4 County Road 187, Abiquiu, NM 87510 (general delivery). 20 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <link href="https://bodes.com/" />
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
