  <wpt lat="36.017322" lon="-106.960486">
    <ele>2103.1</ele>
    <name>Cuba</name>
    <desc>mi 2389.3 (SOBO mi 2389.3) | off. mi 2397.2 | NM | NM (not on an extracted map page) | CDTC Gateway Community, and hikers describe it as having everything: a supermarket on Main Street (US 550), a Family Dollar, a Dollar General, motels and restaurants. The trail passes through the edge of town. It is also the decision point for the Ghost Ranch alternate. The supermarket is untagged by name in OpenStreetMap; the coordinate is that building on US 550. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 6358 Main Street, Cuba, NM 87013 (general delivery). 0.8 mi off trail along the trail. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
