  <wpt lat="35.150833" lon="-107.848975">
    <ele>1968.5</ele>
    <name>Grants (access: CDT through Grants)</name>
    <desc>mi 2495.6 (SOBO mi 2495.6) | off. mi 2503.8 | NM | NM map 82 | Leave the CDT here for Grants: 3.5 mi on foot. CDTC Gateway Community, on the trail. John Brooks Supermarket is the closest full grocery to the route on the west side of town; the Walmart Supercenter is larger but three miles south-east on the far side of I-40.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="35.181412" lon="-107.896696">
    <ele>1969</ele>
    <name>Grants</name>
    <desc>mi 2495.6 (SOBO mi 2495.6) | off. mi 2503.8 | NM | NM map 82 | CDTC Gateway Community, on the trail. John Brooks Supermarket is the closest full grocery to the route on the west side of town; the Walmart Supercenter is larger but three miles south-east on the far side of I-40. Motels, a KOA with showers and laundry, restaurants. About 105 to 110 miles from Cuba, one of the longer carries in New Mexico. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 816 West Santa Fe Avenue, Grants, NM 87020 (general delivery). 3.5 mi off trail on foot. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="35.150398" lon="-107.849155">
    <ele>1969.2</ele>
    <name>Cebolla branches</name>
    <desc>mi 2495.6 (SOBO mi 2495.6) | off. mi 2503.8 | NM | NM map 82 | Cebolla: 86.1 mi against 110.8 mi on the CDT, +4,312 ft. OSM relation 8082741 &apos;Cebolla Route Grants to Pie Town&apos; (ref:ley &apos;NM 20,20b,20c,20d,20e,21,22,24,25,26&apos;), 86.1 mi, both ends within 20 m of the primary line. Runs down Cebolla Canyon on the east side of El Malpais; the sub-relations are 8082740 (jkcCC, Grants south), 8082889 (jkgCC) and 8082910 (jkjCC, into Pie Town).</desc>
    <type>junction</type>
  </wpt>
