  <wpt lat="33.608333" lon="-108.385842">
    <ele>2379.8</ele>
    <name>Reserve (access: CDT at NM 12 near Collins Park)</name>
    <desc>mi 2695.4 (SOBO mi 2695.4) | off. mi 2703.8 | NM | NM map 50 | Leave the CDT here for Reserve: 28 mi by hitching. Jake&apos;s General Merchandise and the Black Gold Emporium on Main Street give Reserve a genuine, if small, resupply - better than its reputation. Motel, restaurants and a post office with unusually good hours.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.713135" lon="-108.757529">
    <ele>1759</ele>
    <name>Reserve</name>
    <desc>mi 2695.4 (SOBO mi 2695.4) | off. mi 2703.8 | NM | NM map 50 | Jake&apos;s General Merchandise and the Black Gold Emporium on Main Street give Reserve a genuine, if small, resupply - better than its reputation. Motel, restaurants and a post office with unusually good hours. About 25 to 30 miles west of where the trail meets NM 12 near Collins Park, on a very quiet road; the hitch, not the shopping, is the problem. Accepts resupply boxes. Post office: 10 Balke Street, Reserve, NM 87830 (general delivery). 28 mi off trail by hitching. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <type>town</type>
  </wpt>
