  <wpt lat="33.071095" lon="-108.087069">
    <ele>2226.3</ele>
    <name>Doc Campbell&apos;s Post (access: CDT primary route nearest Gila Hot Springs)</name>
    <desc>mi 2820.2 (SOBO mi 2820.2) | off. mi 2828.8 | NM | NM map 32 | Leave the CDT here for Doc Campbell&apos;s Post: 12 mi on foot. The store at Gila Hot Springs on NM 15, on the Gila River alternate, and the standard box drop for the Gila. Small but genuinely stocked, with a hiker pre-order service and famous ice cream.</desc>
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.198725" lon="-108.208086">
    <ele>1706.9</ele>
    <name>Doc Campbell&apos;s Post</name>
    <desc>mi 2820.2 (SOBO mi 2820.2) | off. mi 2828.8 | NM | NM map 32 | The store at Gila Hot Springs on NM 15, on the Gila River alternate, and the standard box drop for the Gila. Small but genuinely stocked, with a hiker pre-order service and famous ice cream. Address packages to Your Name (CDT Hiker, ETA) c/o Doc Campbell&apos;s Post, 3796 Highway 15, Mimbres, NM 88049. Hours as published in 2026: Mon, Tue, Thu, Fri 12:00-16:00, Wed closed, Sat-Sun 10:30-16:00 - short, and the shop is shut one weekday, so arriving late in the day is a real risk. The accessFrom point is the CDTC primary line&apos;s nearest approach, well east of the Gila; on the alternate the store is on your route. Accepts resupply boxes. 12 mi off trail on foot. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <link href="https://doccampbellspost.com/" />
    <type>resupply</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.071095" lon="-108.087069">
    <ele>2226.3</ele>
    <name>Gila Hot Springs Campground (access: CDT primary route nearest Gila Hot Springs)</name>
    <desc>mi 2820.2 (SOBO mi 2820.2) | off. mi 2828.8 | NM | NM map 32 | Leave the CDT here for Gila Hot Springs Campground: 12 mi on foot. Riverside campground with natural hot-spring pools, a few hundred metres from Doc Campbell&apos;s on the Gila River alternate. Tent sites, showers and RV hookups. The obvious place to stop when you collect a box at the Post.</desc>
    <type>campsite</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.196351" lon="-108.204974">
    <ele>1706.9</ele>
    <name>Gila Hot Springs Campground</name>
    <desc>mi 2820.2 (SOBO mi 2820.2) | off. mi 2828.8 | NM | NM map 32 | Riverside campground with natural hot-spring pools, a few hundred metres from Doc Campbell&apos;s on the Gila River alternate. Tent sites, showers and RV hookups. The obvious place to stop when you collect a box at the Post. 12 mi off trail on foot. Checked 2026-09.</desc>
    <link href="http://gilahotspringscampground.com/" />
    <type>campsite</type>
  </wpt>
