    <desc>mi 2829.4 (SOBO mi 2829.4) | off. mi 2838.0 | NM | NM map 30 | CDTC official mile 200, counted northbound from Crazy Cook. Official SOBO mile 2838.0; geometric SOBO mile 2829.4.</desc>
